{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "叔", "id": "叔"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "炙", "id": "炙"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.0923403120739157, "source": "死", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 2.9100187552799612, "source": "死", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 2.8410258837930096, "source": "道", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 3.7573166156671647, "source": "道", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.083340182095493, "source": "行", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 3.246490991901174, "source": "行", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 1.6370530794670737, "source": "智", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.147878703233064, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.7764873626554385, "source": "智", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.7573166156671647, "source": "智", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.911489925168834, "source": "智", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.25075871834718305, "source": "心", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 0.7207623475929187, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.4843735695286883, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.2315879713589093, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.6238078527170532, "source": "外", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.454731522673119, "source": "外", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.3710222545472743, "source": "外", "target": "炙"}, {"weight": 2.265661738889448, "source": "外", "tar